<p>A similar incident: A woman was condemned for publishing a photo of a smile taken at the Auschwitz concentration camp.<br />
why?</p>
<p>Personally, as a national of the victims of war, I will never write a story about &quot;731 troops&quot; in this way.<br />
It is also difficult for me to imagine that people from countries with 731 injuries will write this story.<br />
